---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Manage skills shared with agents in sandboxes (experimental)

Usage: sbt skills [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  add     Add skills from a Git repository [alias: a]
  import  Import skills from supported agent directories
  ls      List installed skills [alias: list]
  rm      Remove installed skills [alias: remove]
  update  Update skills added from repositories [alias: upgrade]
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Print each smolvm command line

  -h, --help
          Print help
